    'Qwen3.8Max(Max)V3': "This offline WebGL2 build draws matching ellipses using measured eccentricities, periods, and simplified inclinations, with a moving belt, image-space Bloom, and ACES. Display axes, orientations, and phases are custom and lack a real epoch. The coplanar Moon is invalid; the e=.86/i=9-degree object labeled Halley is not genuine Halley and earns no other-comet bonus. Rings have no physical shadows and atmospheres are surface rim light. Roughly ten-times-slow spin and Venus's wrong tilt reduce data only. Focus, continuous follow, and the safe 40-unit zoom limit work, with no full reset. RGBA8 postprocessing needs no float extension and has no scene MSAA.",
