    'GLM5.3(Max)V3': { title: 'Solar System Motion Model · WebGL2' , note: "This offline WebGL2 build has JPL secular elements, Kepler solving, matching paths, two moving belts, Halley/Encke, Bloom/ACES, and follow. Of ten moons, the Moon is incorrectly equatorial; the other nine parent-relative circles, including correctly retrograde Triton, remain valid."},
